<title>USA: Tele-Communications Inc Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>Tele-Communications Inc Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>ENGLEWOOD, Colo. 1997-03-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Net profit		724,000     loss	64,000</p>
<p> Revs		    2,155,000		1,799,000</p>
<p>			     YEAR</p>
<p> Net profit		278,000     loss     171,000</p>
<p> Revs		    8,022,000		6,506,000</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s)</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures above include results for TCI Group, as follows:</p>
<p>Q4 revs are $1.87 bln vs $1.41 bln, Q4 net is loss $296 million vs loss $42 million.</p>
<p>TCI Group yr revs are $6.79 bln vs $5.15 bln, net is loss $778 million vs loss $144 million.</p>
<p>Share break-out is as follows for yr 1996 vs yr 1995:</p>
<p>TCI Class A and Class B common shr is zero vs loss $0.11.</p>
<p>TCI Group Series A and Series B common shr is loss $1.22 vs loss $0.16.</p>
<p>Liberty Media Group Series A and Series B common shr is profit $3.97 vs loss $0.11 primary and profit $3.88 vs loss $0.11 fully diluted.</p>
<p>Q4 share results not immediately available.</p>
</text>
